      "settings": {
        "anchor": "nutrition",
        "heading": "Meet your baker",
        "body": "<p>I'm Daniel, the brain and brawn behind ProDani. As a personal trainer, I couldn't find cakes and muffins that were high in protein, gluten-free and low in sugar, so I started baking my own.</p><p>Every cake is my labor of love: small batches, top-notch ingredients and a dash of passion. If I wouldn't give it to my own clients, it doesn't go in the box.</p>",
        "cta_label": "Read my story",
        "cta_link": "/pages/meet-your-baker",
        "image_alt": "Dani with a ProDani strawberry short cake",
        "badge_text": "dessert you can feel good about ✦ ",
        "badge_speed": 26,
        "bundled_photo": "prodani-dani-2",
        "ribbon_items": "chocolate fudge, vanilla bean, strawberry, cookie butter, matcha, salted caramel",
        "ribbon_speed": 38,
        "photo_focus": "50% 12%"
      }
    },
